    "additionalInformation": "<p></p><p style=\"line-height:1.62;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:7pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Thank you for booking with Hop on Hop off Wine Tours!</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Please read all information supplied in your tickets.</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Please be aware we have now added a $10 fuel fee, due to the on going increase to gas prices.  </span></p><p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-left\"><b style=\"font-weight:normal;\"><br></b></p><p style=\"line-height:1.62;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:7pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#19232d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">For Saturday</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.62;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:7pt;\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://hoponhopoffwinetours.com/maps/queenstown-saturday-map/\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#0088cc;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;https://hoponhopoffwinetours.com/maps/queenstown-saturday-map/</span></a></p><p style=\"line-height:1.62;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:7pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">For Sunday - Friday:</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.62;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:7pt;\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://hoponhopoffwinetours.com/maps/queenstown-wine-tour/\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#0088cc;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">https://hoponhopoffwinetours.com/maps/queenstown-wine-tour/</span></a></p><p style=\"line-height:1.656;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 35, 45); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; white-space-collapse: collapse;\">P</span><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 35, 45); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; white-space-collapse: collapse;\">lease scroll below the map for the timetable, and below the timetable for&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 35, 45); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; white-space-collapse: collapse;\">the venue information.</span><br></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.656;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Pick up</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.656;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Station Information Centre outside Marmolada Cafe (43 Camp Street Queenstown).&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.656;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.656;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Venue Information</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.656;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Please ensure you book lunch to avoid disappointment on the day. </span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.656;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">We also recommend pre-booking some tastings if touring during the week and weekends.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.656;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.656;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Due to staffing restrictions at wineries and increased demand, if you are travelling Saturday or Sunday we recommend you book all your stops. </span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.656;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Stop information with contact details provided at the above links. </span></p><p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-left\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 700; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-left\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 700; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Bookings are always required the below venues (regardless of the day or size of your group):</span><br></p><p style=\"line-height:1.656;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Stop 10.</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.656;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Mora Winery (formally Akarua):</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Bookings required for tastings and lunch. Please text to book tastings (02102372489).  </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.656;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><b style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-size: 14.6667px;\">Stop 11.</b><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.656;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><b style=\"text-align: start; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14.6667px;\">Amisfield</b>: Please phone us (0800 693 72273) To go on out list (6 people at a time only at one time) Please be aware there are no bookings for tastings at Amisfield, you will be a walk in!   </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.656;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Stop 18. </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.656;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Kinross Winery and Bistro:</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Accept bookings only, Please book direct - can be called on the day. +64 3 746 7269</span></p><p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-left\"><b style=\"font-weight:normal;\"><br></b></p><p style=\"line-height:1.656;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Larger Groups</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.656;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">You are welcome to travel as a larger group on our buses. However, if your group is larger than 8 people please notify us first for logistical reasons.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.656;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.656;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">If you had a fantastic day and would like to leave us a review afterwards you can do so on Google Reviews, Trip Advisor, Facebook or Book Me. </span><br></span></p><p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-left\"><br></p><p style=\"line-height:1.656;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">We hope you enjoy your tour with HoHo!</span></p>",
